WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:17.404
Emmy and Harry were playing with friends.

2
00:00:17.405 --> 00:00:21.180
They were all playing in the tree house.

3
00:00:21.181 --> 00:00:27.352
Oliver wanted to play too.

4
00:00:27.353 --> 00:00:32.193
"Not now," the older kids said.

5
00:00:32.194 --> 00:00:43.554
"No fair!" Oliver said.

6
00:00:43.555 --> 00:00:47.259
"Let's have a club," Harry said.

7
00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:50.485
"Good idea," Emmy said.

8
00:00:50.486 --> 00:00:54.991
"What should we call it?"

9
00:00:54.992 --> 00:00:57.978
Jim grinned at Harry.

10
00:00:57.979 --> 00:01:02.756
"Let's call it the Boys Only Club!"

11
00:01:02.757 --> 00:01:07.285
"No fair!" Emmy said.

12
00:01:07.286 --> 00:01:11.074
Sarah grinned at Emmy.

13
00:01:11.075 --> 00:01:15.086
"We can have our own club, Emmy.

14
00:01:15.087 --> 00:01:20.294
We'll call it the No Boys Allowed Club."

15
00:01:20.295 --> 00:01:27.259
"No fair!" Harry said.

16
00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:30.794
"Time for lunch," Mom called.

17
00:01:30.795 --> 00:01:33.059
Emmy looked at Harry.

18
00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:36.769
"Who plays in the tree house after lunch?"

19
00:01:36.770 --> 00:01:43.454
"The club that gets there first!" Harry said.

20
00:01:43.455 --> 00:01:49.948
The kids ate lunch.

21
00:01:49.949 --> 00:01:57.352
The girls and boys finished at the same time.

22
00:01:57.353 --> 00:02:00.302
Then they raced to the tree house.

23
00:02:00.303 --> 00:02:04.649
They all got there at the same time.

24
00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:07.641
"Uh-oh," Jim said.

25
00:02:07.642 --> 00:02:19.741
"Someone is already in the tree house."

26
00:02:19.742 --> 00:02:22.335
It was Oliver!

27
00:02:22.336 --> 00:02:29.482
"I have a club too," he said.

28
00:02:29.483 --> 00:02:35.326
"Can Sarah and I be in your club?" Emmy asked.

29
00:02:35.327 --> 00:02:41.870
"Can Jim and I be in your club?" Harry asked.

30
00:02:41.871 --> 00:02:48.384
Oliver grinned. "My club is fair," he said.

31
00:02:48.385 --> 00:03:00.369
"It's for everybody!"
